  "text": "Regular meetings about once a month, usually a Wednesday at 11:00 a.m., in the School Board Administration Building Auditorium, 1450 NE 2nd Avenue, Miami 33132. The public hearing for non-agenda topics follows the regular agenda and begins no later than about 6:30 p.m. Budget hearings are evening special meetings at 6:00 p.m. Workshops (budget, safety) are usually 10:00 a.m. The Board sets each year's schedule at its November Organization Meeting.",
